Looking at the problem, I need to evaluate $\lim_{n \to \infty} \frac{\sqrt[n]{a_2 a_3 \cdots a_{n+1}}}{a_{n+1}}$ where $a_n$ is the largest $k$ with $k! \leq \alpha^n$, $\alpha > 1$.

